      "side": 1,
      "message": "```suggestion\n\n  /* class of device */\n  cod \u003d devclass2uint(dev_class);\n  if ((cod \u003d\u003d 0 || cod \u003d\u003d COD_UNCLASSIFIED)) {\n    uint32_t old_cod \u003d get_cod(\u0026bdaddr);\n    if (old_cod !\u003d cod) {\n      log::info(\"{} CoD: 0x{:06x} -\u003e 0x{:06x}\", ADDRESS_TO_LOGGABLE_CSTR(bdaddr),\n                old_cod, cod);\n      cod \u003d old_cod;\n    }\n  }\n```",
